    "Name": "Dire Wolf",
    "Details": "While the standard Dire Wolf set the golden standard for death-dealing among the Clans, there were those on the fringes who believed that it could be improved upon for short duels and so, this mech came to be. Called the Direstar (because it glows as bright as the sun when it fires), this monster carries 11 Clan-tech ER PPCs. Of course, it can't fire them all at once, it can barely fire two, but that's not the point. The point is to vaporize the target in a hail of PPC fire and then shut down to vent the massive waste heat. The mech carries virtually no armor as a result, being exclusively a first-strike weapon.",
